0), since the book says it adds to the body - judgement: the sheet then shows one 700 M.D.C. total and the layering (armor first) is prose. Arms/legs 50 and hands/feet 15 each, half damage from energy, double from impact, full from magic are prose in the ability. The race''s 2D6x10 S.D.C. and hit points still compose onto the sheet; the book says nothing about them after conversion. || ATTRIBUTES: Robotic P.S. 40, P.P. 25, running speed 120 mph are FIXED values, not dice; attribute_dice cannot set them in a pairing (the race''s dice win) and a bonus would add to the roll, so they are prose in Bionic Attributes. Attribute Requirements: none (bionics replace most physical attributes). || BONUSES: printed +1 initiative, +2 roll with impact, +5 save vs Horror Factor, plus attribute, bionic and skill bonuses. The +1 initiative and +2 roll are the race''s own figures restated, and bonuses sum across a pairing, so only the difference is stored: +2 horror_factor (race 3 + 2 = the printed 5). The race''s +2 pull punch and +2 save vs magic carry through; the O.C.C. does not mention them. Judgement call. || PSIONICS: the book says nothing about psionics for this class. Not stored, so an Arkhon Spectral Hunter still rolls on the standard psionics table; the book does not print the usual loss of psionics to full conversion here. || SKILLS: Arkhon 98 and literacy 98 restated; Computer Operation 40+15 = 55; Radio: Basic 45+15 = 60; Tracking: Animals and humans (+15%) -> Tracking (people) 25+15 = 40 (judgement: the one tracking row; Track & Trap Animals is a separate Wilderness skill and is not granted); Detect Ambush 30+15 = 45; Prowl 25+15 = 40 (the chameleon +5% is an ability, left in prose so the printed skill figure stands); W.P. Energy Rifle, W.P. Energy Pistol, W.P. Sword, W.P. one of choice; Hand to Hand: Expert, to Martial Arts for one other skill. || RELATED: 6, plus one at levels 3, 5, 8, 11 and 14. All Any: Communications +10, Electrical +5, Espionage +10, Mechanical +5, Military +5, Pilot Related +5, Rogue +5, Science +5, Technical +10, Wilderness +10; Domestic, Physical, Pilot and W.P. none. Medical +5% on paramedic only is a note, as for the race. Secondary: 4. These replace the race''s 8 and 5 in a pairing. || EQUIPMENT: two energy weapons of choice, one vibro-blade or archaic weapon of choice and four E-clips per weapon. Equipment sums across a pairing and the race already issues an energy rifle, an energy pistol and an archaic-or-modern choice that includes the vibro-blades, so only the eight E-clips are stored (catalog e-clip; the book''s Arkhon clips have no separate row). The race''s armor, communicator, survival kit and knife therefore also arrive, which the O.C.C. does not print. Captured weapons carried as badges of honor are lore. || MONEY: 2D4x1000 Arkhon credits stored as printed; in a pairing the race''s 1D6x1000 wins by the composition rule, so this figure shows on the class detail only. class-check''s racial-discard warning names mdc_base and starting_money: mdc_base survives because the Arkhon R.C.C. states none, and starting_money is discarded as described; NOT supersedes_race, since the book does not say the character stops being an Arkhon. || Alignment: any, 70% evil and 25% anarchist - GM notes."
