## Lore

The Tlo-Arkhon clan was known among its people for its cybernetics, built not
from metal but from advanced ceramics and polymers - Cerasteel, a tough,
almost organic-feeling material that sheds energy weapons better than Earth
alloys. The Spectral Hunters are volunteers rebuilt with it: full conversion
cyborgs who look less like machines than like spiny, hard-shelled creatures,
close enough to biomancer armor to fool people at a glance.

Their chameleon shells let them move unseen through mountains and jungle,
where they hunt enemy patrols and scouts and slip past enemy positions as
scouts themselves. They are also the instrument of the army''s terror raids,
and many grow savage from them. Given the choice they seek out worthy foes -
True Incas, Rune Warriors, the Legion''s Destroyer ''Borgs - and their duels can
flatten whole stretches of jungle.

## GM Notes

Alignment: any, but about 70% are evil and 25% anarchist.
